OL,3,GNEWSAPark trees to be felled after elm
OL,4,Adisease outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Alan Robins said: "It's
OL,7,Falways sad when trees have to be
OL,8,Ffelled, but the work planned for
OL,9,FWithdean Park is essential to manage
OL,10,Fthe ongoing problem of elm disease and
OL,11,Fto protect other healthy trees."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
